  "title": "The Void",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "What do you know about the dark? When you look into the shadows, do you feel them watching back? In the town of Milton, the darkness isn't just in your head, it lives in the woods. They call it The Void, a cursed expanse that surrounds town, swallowing anyone who dares to leave. At the center of the fear lurks the Hat Man, a figure of nightmares, or perhaps something worse... As we enter into our second season, the monsters of The Void have only begun to reveal their darkness. In the highly anticipated continuation of our epic journey, disasters intensify and shadows walk among us, as nightmares turn all too real... The Void is a Webby nominated, full cast audio drama. Tread carefully though. While the characters of The Void may be fictional, you might find yourself confronting your own reality and those things that bind you.",
